891 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 125 0 R
/T (Counterfeiting kills people. It is also, in 2025, a problem that is technically solvable at accessible cost. The combination of NFC hardware, now ubiquitous in smartphones across South Asia, and elliptic curve cryptography, which provides 128-bit security in a 72-byte signature, makes it possible to attach an unforgeable identity to a physical object for under BDT 15 per unit.)
/E (Counterfeiting kills people. It is also, in 2025, a problem that is technically solvable at accessible cost. The combination of NFC hardware, now ubiquitous in smartphones across South Asia, and elliptic curve cryptography, which provides 128-bit security in a 72-byte signature, makes it possible to attach an unforgeable identity to a physical object for under BDT 15 per unit.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [39]
>>
endobj
892 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 125 0 R
/T (TagWraps is not a research exercise in applied cryptography. It is a commercial system under active development, validated by prototype demonstration to over 10,000 individuals at national innovation events, and pursuing regulatory engagement with Bangladesh's pharmaceutical oversight authorities. The system's cryptographic security rests on the ECDLP hardness assumption, the same foundation as TLS 1.3 and modern passport authentication. Its operational security rests on a layered architecture combining hardware lock mechanisms, server-side fraud detection, and tamper-evident physical design.)
/E (TagWraps is not a research exercise in applied cryptography. It is a commercial system under active development, validated by prototype demonstration to over 10,000 individuals at national innovation events, and pursuing regulatory engagement with Bangladesh's pharmaceutical oversight authorities. The system's cryptographic security rests on the ECDLP hardness assumption, the same foundation as TLS 1.3 and modern passport authentication. Its operational security rests on a layered architecture combining hardware lock mechanisms, server-side fraud detection, and tamper-evident physical design.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [40]
>>
endobj
893 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 125 0 R
/T (The author recognises that technical capability is necessary but not sufficient. Adoption requires regulatory engagement, manufacturer education, and consumer trust-building over time. Each of those is a genuine challenge. However, the reception of TrueMedi across six national events, from patients who depend on authentic medicines, from pharmacists who are alarmed to discover counterfeits in their own supply, and from government officials who understand the scale of the problem, suggests that the demand is real, the problem is urgent, and the solution is ready for deployment.)
/E (The author recognises that technical capability is necessary but not sufficient. Adoption requires regulatory engagement, manufacturer education, and consumer trust-building over time. Each of those is a genuine challenge. However, the reception of TrueMedi across six national events, from patients who depend on authentic medicines, from pharmacists who are alarmed to discover counterfeits in their own supply, and from government officials who understand the scale of the problem, suggests that the demand is real, the problem is urgent, and the solution is ready for deployment.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [41]
>>
endobj
894 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 125 0 R
/T (TagWraps is the authentication layer that physical commerce in developing economies has needed for a long time. The cryptography exists. The hardware exists. The phones are already in consumers' hands. What has been missing is a system designed deliberately for this context, at this price point, by someone who understands the problem from the inside. That system is now built.)
/E (TagWraps is the authentication layer that physical commerce in developing economies has needed for a long time. The cryptography exists. The hardware exists. The phones are already in consumers' hands. What has been missing is a system designed deliberately for this context, at this price point, by someone who understands the problem from the inside. That system is now built.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [42]
>>
